.mdx","Use Lamassu as SaaS","Consume Lamassu as a managed service without operating your own infrastructure.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/deployment/saas",{"_77":441},"deployment/saas.mdx","en:deployment",{"_201":444},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/images/kubernetes.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_59":60,"_54":447,"_61":62,"_63":-7,"_64":448,"_66":-7,"_56":449,"_52":457,"_75":458,"_73":460},"Upgrades","Version-to-version operator guide",[450],{"_52":451,"_59":70,"_54":452,"_64":453,"_73":-7,"_12":454,"_75":455},"en:upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","3.8.0 to 4.0.0","What changes in the 4.0.0 architecture, which changes break a 3.8.0 deployment, how to upgrade a Helm release step by step and how to validate the result.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0",{"_77":456},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","en:upgrades",{"_201":459},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 12-4-4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16V8\"></path></svg>",{"_52":462,"_59":70,"_54":463,"_64":464,"_73":-7,"_12":465,"_75":466},"en:security.mdx","Security","How to report a security vulnerability in Lamassu privately, what to include in a report and which releases receive security fixes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/security",{"_77":467},"security.mdx","fallback"]
